#. Translators: Title of the add-on's category in the NVDA settings dialog.
#: addon/globalPlugins/contentFirstBrowse.py buildVars.py
msgid "Browse mode content first"
msgstr "浏览模式内容优先"

#. Translators: Long description shown in the Add-on Store.
#: buildVars.py
msgid "In browse mode content is read before role and state information."
msgstr "在浏览模式下移动时，在角色和状态之前先朗读内容。"

#. Translators: Changes in this add-on release shown in the Add-on Store.
#: buildVars.py
msgid "Improved initial browse mode caret navigation, added a setting to enable or disable content-first speech, and added NVDA 2026.1 compatibility."
msgstr "改进了首次浏览模式光标导航，新增了启用或停用内容优先朗读的设置，并增加了对 NVDA 2026.1 的兼容。"

#. Translators: Checkbox that enables content-first speech in browse mode.
#: addon/globalPlugins/contentFirstBrowse.py
msgid "&Enable content-first speech in browse mode"
msgstr "启用浏览模式内容优先朗读(&E)"
